flowchart LR
    A["Scope the diligence<br/>time, access, priorities"] --> B["Request list and interviews<br/>question bank"]
    B --> C["Score the assessment<br/>weighted domains, RAG"]
    C --> D{"Red flags?"}
    D -->|"Deal-breaker"| E["Stop or re-price<br/>walk away rights"]
